<Base title="Shipping" page="shipping"><section class="inner container"><div class="eyebrow" data-i="PLAN YOUR PARCEL">PLAN YOUR PARCEL</div><h1 data-i="PikoBuy shipping guide">PikoBuy shipping guide<span>.</span></h1><p class="lead" data-i="shippingintro">A practical guide to understanding the costs and checks between the warehouse and your door.</p><div class="article"><h2 data-i="Start with the whole cost">Start with the whole cost</h2><p data-i="shipping1">The product price is only one part of your budget. International shipping is paid after items reach the warehouse and you submit a parcel. Allow for any applicable taxes, packaging or other charges, and check the current quote before paying.</p><h2 data-i="Weight, size and route">Weight, size and route</h2><p data-i="shipping2">Carriers may calculate charges using actual or dimensional weight. Parcel dimensions, destination, product type and available routes can affect the estimate. Compare the options shown for your actual parcel rather than relying on a fixed per-kilogram figure.</p><h2 data-i="Before you ship">Before you ship</h2><p data-i="shipping3">Review warehouse photos, confirm the items and variants, and resolve any concerns before submitting your parcel. Check route restrictions, packaging choices, tracking and the latest delivery estimates in your PikoBuy account.</p><a class="primary" href="https://www.pikobuy.com/register?invitedCode=KPNJVF&inviteUserId=1109716" data-i="Register">Register ↗</a></div></section></Base>
